{
  "comment": "Requests that a recorder sends to the real archive retention tags API (/dataengine/retention-tags/v1), and the offline test sends to the fake. Paths are relative to that path. The tenant has its 4 retention tags. Tokens: {{ID1}}..{{ID4}} are the tag ids in the order Get returns them; {{NAME2}}..{{NAME4}} are the names of tags 2 to 4 when recording starts. The first tag is always named Default. Every case that can change a name restores the starting names and reads them back.",
